---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"archive\")"
---
Maintain the on-disk memory log; its one operation is unpinning entries (--force-unpin)

Usage: archive [OPTIONS] [EVENT_ID]

Arguments:
  [EVENT_ID]
          The event id to unpin. Mutually exclusive with --all

Options:
      --force-unpin
          Clear the `pinned` flag so the next pruning pass can remove the entry

      --all
          Unpin every entry. Mutually exclusive with EVENT_ID

  -h, --help
          Print help
